        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "national tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        351.4517822265625,
        21.884788513183594,
        407.7772216796875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "programmes on",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        407.7772216796875,
        21.884788513183594,
        518.984130859375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "the management of tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        518.984130859375,
        21.884788513183594,
        557.1551513671875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        83.11911010742188,
        510.2310485839844,
        96.53961181640625
      ],
      "text": "Recommendations for investigating contacts of persons with infectious tu- Source:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        96.91909790039062,
        513.450927734375,
        110.339599609375
      ],
      "text": "berculosis in low- and middle-income countries.  Geneva, World Health Organization",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        110.7880859375,
        245.43191528320312,
        124.13958740234375
      ],
      "text": "2012 (WHO/HTM/TB/2012.9)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        132.78759765625,
        513.46240234375,
        146.13909912109375
      ],
      "text": "In the resource-constrained setting, screening of contacts of sputum smear-positive",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        148.78411865234375,
        513.4049682617188,
        162.1356201171875
      ],
      "text": "cases is prioritized; sputum smear-positive cases are the most likely to transmit infection",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        164.7806396484375,
        513.3818969726562,
        178.13214111328125
      ],
      "text": "with exposure. NTPs may decide to include contacts of all TB index cases for screening,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        180.77716064453125,
        250.7793731689453,
        194.128662109375
      ],
      "text": "depending on available resources.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        202.44317626953125,
        513.41650390625,
        215.794677734375
      ],
      "text": "In some settings, screening of child contacts includes TST to screen for infection and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        218.439697265625,
        513.4050903320312,
        231.79119873046875
      ],
      "text": "chest X-ray (CXR) to screen for disease. However, routine assessment of exposed",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        234.43621826171875,
        513.46240234375,
        247.7877197265625
      ],
      "text": "contacts does not require CXR or TST. These tests have limitations and are often not",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        250.4327392578125,
        513.3704833984375,
        263.78424072265625
      ],
      "text": "readily available or possible in low- and middle-income settings. In the absence of TST",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        266.42926025390625,
        513.473876953125,
        279.78076171875
      ],
      "text": "or CXR, clinical assessment alone is sufficient to decide whether the contact is well or",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        282.42578125,
        150.83290100097656,
        295.77728271484375
      ],
      "text": "symptomatic.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        304.091796875,
        513.3704223632812,
        317.44329833984375
      ],
      "text": "Figure 1 provides a simple algorithmic approach that can be applied in any setting and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        320.0882873535156,
        513.382080078125,
        333.4397888183594
      ],
      "text": "requires information only on age, HIV status and the presence or absence of symptoms",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        336.0157775878906,
        513.3704833984375,
        349.436279296875
      ],
      "text": "(16) . A symptom-based approach means that screening can be done by health workers",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        352.0812683105469,
        513.41650390625,
        365.4327697753906
      ],
      "text": "at a peripheral level: access to a district-level health facility is not needed. Only",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        368.0777587890625,
        513.4049682617188,
        381.42926025390625
      ],
      "text": "symptomatic contacts may require referral to the secondary level for further assessment.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        384.0742492675781,
        513.4050903320312,
        397.4257507324219
      ],
      "text": "Recent research on symptom-based screening of child TB contacts indicates that this",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        400.07073974609375,
        513.3936157226562,
        413.4222412109375
      ],
      "text": "contact management strategy is safe and more feasible than diagnostic test-based",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        415.99822998046875,
        331.0494079589844,
        429.4187316894531
      ],
      "text": "(17) contact screening in resource-limited settings  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        128.45849609375,
        453.2166748046875,
        422.11822509765625,
        469.9344482421875
      ],
      "text": "Symptom-based screening approach to child contact management",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-CondensedB",
      "size": 10.984100341796875,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.34500122070312,
        453.46929931640625,
        125.40491485595703,
        469.9454345703125
      ],
      "text": "Figure 1",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.984100341796875,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        125.40491485595703,
        453.46929931640625,
        425.1941833496094,
        469.9454345703125
      ],
      "text": ". a",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.984100341796875,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        158.08250427246094,
        480.7890930175781,
        467.12432861328125,
        495.8923034667969
      ],
      "text": "Child in close contact with source case of smear-positive pulmonary TB",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.06879997253418,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        179.72035217285156,
        537.142578125,
        430.0867919921875,
        552.2473754882812
      ],
      "text": "Under 5 years or over Under 5 years of age",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.06879997253418,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        140.17340087890625,
        589.5424194335938,
        455.3662414550781,
        605.1138916015625
      ],
      "text": "Well Symptomatic Symptomatic Well b b",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.06879997253418,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        141.25770568847656,
        644.0964965820312,
        498.2698974609375,
        659.19970703125
      ],
      "text": "6H Evaluate for TB disease No preventive treatment c e",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.06879997253418,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        413.7724609375,
        656.1790771484375,
        479.0604553222656,
        671.2822875976562
      ],
      "text": "if HIV-negative d",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.06879997253418,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        95.62059783935547,
        713.3065795898438,
        499.5699768066406,
        728.4097900390625
      ],
      "text": "If becomes symptomatic If becomes symptomatic",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 10.06879997253418,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.34500122070312,
        734.2994995117188,
        465.2513122558594,
        745.2835693359375
      ],
      "text": "As discussed in Chapter 3, all children diagnosed with TB disease should be promptly treated and reported to the NTP. a",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 7.322700023651123,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.34500122070312,
        743.0867919921875,
        236.15440368652344,
        754.0708618164062
      ],
      "text": "If TB disease is suspected, refer to Chapter 3. b",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 7.322700023651123,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.34500122070312,
        751.8742065429688,
        256.3130798339844,
        762.8582763671875
      ],
      "text": "Isoniazid 10 mg/kg (7−15 mg/kg) daily for 6 months. c",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 7.322700023651123,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.34500122070312,
        760.6611328125,
        319.8308410644531,
        771.6452026367188
      ],
      "text": "If HIV-positive, isoniazid daily for 6 months is indicated regardless of age. d",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 7.322700023651123,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.34500122070312,
        769.4485473632812,
        433.8955993652344,
        780.4326171875
      ],
      "text": "If the child is diagnosed with TB disease, anti-TB treatment is started and the child is registered with the NTP. e",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 7.322700023651123,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.34172058105469,
        778.2357788085938,
        338.6786804199219,
        789.2198486328125
      ],
      "text": "If TB disease is excluded, the child needs to be considered for eligibility for IPT.",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 7.322700023651123,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        558.6439208984375,
        805.8439331054688,
        580.8839111328125,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "47",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}